==Serbo-Croatian==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|sla-pro|sh}} {{m|sla-pro|*ljudije||people, men}},from {{etyl|ine-bsl-pro|sh}} {{m|ine-bsl-pro|*leų̃deį̃ěs||people, men}} from {{etyl|ine-pro|sh}} {{m|ine-pro|*h₁lewdʰ-}}.

===Noun===
{{sh-noun|g=m|head=ljȗdi|r|људи|љу̑ди}} (singular: {{l|sh|čȍvjek}} / {{l|sh|čȍvek}})

# [[people]], [[men]]
#: Dva ''čovjeka'' su išla cestom — ''Two '''men''' walked down the street.''
#: Pet ''ljudi'' je išlo cestom. — ''Five '''people''' walked down the street.''

